PUNISHER 1.0 by RAHLONNIR

MOVESET 

6 buttons
Crouching Strong Punch Launcher
Crouching Strong Kick sweep
Standing Strong Kick has a wall bounce

Can cancel from normals to special
Can cancel from special to hyper

*MOVEMENT*

Down,Up/up after launcher hits - Super Jump
Fwd/Back while down - Recover
Up/a+b while hit in air - Recover

FF - Roll
BB - HopBack

Reload using start(CAN ONLY RELOAD ON AN EMPTY CLIP)

Crouch+Start(TOGGLE BETWEEN grenade,tear gas, molotov)

Fire gun using StandingStrongPunch,CrouchingStrongKick,JumpingStrongKick

*MISC*

PRESS START TO RELOAD
WHEN OUT OF BULLETS HE SWITCHES TO MELEE ATTACKS
THE ONES WITH GUN MOVES ARE "STANDING STRONG PUNCH,CROUCHGING STRONG KICK,JUMPING STRONG PUNCH"

